{"id":"626156","name":"花生拌山麻楂菜","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/626156/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"霞草","amount":"200g"},{"name":"花生","amount":"一把"}],"sub":[{"name":"食用油","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"霞草洗净。","img":"images/626156/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅烧开水，放霞草焯水。","img":"images/626156/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"煮开锅即可。","img":"images/626156/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"捞出冷水浸泡。","img":"images/626156/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"撰干水分。","img":"images/626156/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"冷锅冷油放花生米。","img":"images/626156/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"慢慢炒熟，盛出来放凉。","img":"images/626156/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"霞草里放食盐。","img":"images/626156/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放鸡精。","img":"images/626156/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放白糖。","img":"images/626156/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放香油。","img":"images/626156/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/626156/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"大蒜去皮洗净切末。","img":"images/626156/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"花生捣碎，大颗粒就好。","img":"images/626156/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放蒜末和花生碎拌匀。","img":"images/626156/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/626156/step_16.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}